            <ArticleTitle>Evaluation of interaction between valproate and baclofen in the formalin test in mice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>51-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Valproate and baclofen dose-dependently inhibited both phases of the formalin test. Combination of valproate and baclofen exerted the additive antinociceptive effect on both phases of the formalin test.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
